:: AGALW-EAPov {"position":"575,450","size":"100,100"}
You are lying in your bed, staring at the ceiling. 
-
You:
(It’s a nice day outside. I should see if any of my friends want to do anything. )
-
You text your friends, Kim and Beverly, and agree to have a picnic at the new lawn. Your mom drives you to the lawn with some snacks and a blanket. Your friends finally arrive, and everyone walks over.
-
Kim:
“God, what’s that smell?” 
-
You:
(She is right, it smells really bad.) 
-
You:
“Do you guys want to just go?”
-
Beverly:
“Well, it was your idea, do you want to?”
-
(text-style:"underline")[Do you leave or stay?]

[[Leave ->Leave]] - [[Stay->Stay]]



:: AGALW-LWPOV {"position":"375,450","size":"100,100"}
''Liam'':
“Mommmm can we pleaseeee go outside? I’m sooo booooored!” 
-
You turn around to see your two children, Sam and Liam, behind you.
-
''Sam'':
“I promise we’ll be good!”
-
''You'':
//(Didn’t they just upgrade that preserve nearby?)//
-
''You'':
“Okay, but Mommy gets to decide where we go.”
-
You round them up into the car and go to the preserve. Once you arrive, there are 3 paths. The left path appears to lead to a cove, the middle path appears to be an easy path, and the right path looks more difficult.
-
''Sam:''
“ Let’s go to the left.”
-
''Liam:''
“But, I want to go on the right path!” 
-
